            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुरामुळे गावातली परिस्थिती बिकट झाली. purāmuḷe gāvātlī paristhitī bikaṭ jhālī. Because of the flood, things in the village became dire."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mostly of a situation or a road: बिकट (bikaṭ) परिस्थिती, बिकट (bikaṭ) वाट."
            }
          ]
        },
